//! One-off tasks, invoked as `cargo loco task <name>`.
//!
//! Loco's clap layer gives every task argument parsing, `--help` and listing,
//! so these need no binary and no dependency of their own (§6.15).
//!
//! * `seed_dictionary` — the `sys_*` Application Dictionary rows.
//! * `ensure_admin` — the administrator, from `ADMIN_EMAIL` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD`.
//! * `seed_workflows` — the model's `kind: saga` workflow definitions.
//! * `seed_rules` — the decision graphs the model's `%%rule` sections compile to.
//! * `seed_access` — the roles and restrictions the model's `%%rbac` declared.
//! * `seed_system` — the configuration keys an operator may change at run time.
//! * `seed_business` — demonstration records for the model's own entities.
//! * `seed_reports` — the questions the model's `%%report` directives asked.
//!
//! All eight are also run, in this order, by `cargo loco db seed`.

pub mod ensure_admin;
pub mod seed_access;
pub mod seed_business;
pub mod seed_dictionary;
pub mod seed_reports;
pub mod seed_rules;
pub mod seed_system;
pub mod seed_workflows;
